WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.729
Let's log some real work. This is the operator's view.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.350
Open Shop floor KPI.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.536
First, pick who you are.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.171
Find your job, and hit Start on the first operation.

00:00:13.771 --> 00:00:16.585
The clock's running. When you're done, hit End.

00:00:17.185 --> 00:00:21.203
Enter the good parts and any scrap, add a note, then End and log.

00:00:21.803 --> 00:00:26.890
Every entry lands in the operation log, with the time, the person, and the quantities.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.545
And that's a shift, logged.

